      "block_id": "2605.00155_p56_b39",
      "text": "The first inequality in (H.2) follows because the average of the first j entries of a decreasing\nk-support probability vector is at least the average of all k supported entries. For j \u2265k,\nthe left-hand side equals 1, while the right-hand side is at most 1. Hence\n",
